+    `ActiveJob::TestHelper` no longer overrides an explicit `:inline` test adapter
+    automatically).
+  - `test/unit/mailer_test.rb`: updated `test_reminders` selector to
+    `assert_select 'p', :text => 'View all issues (2 open)'` for
+    `dom_testing_default_html_version = :html5`.
 
